# WHAT A HAND CAN DO WITH WHAT IT HOLDS. Simple things, one blow each. Stringing them together is the player's own business
# (the combo editor, K); none is written here.
#
#   weapon NAME [model FILE]                  what it looks like: a skin in assets/world/weapons, held in the right hand
#   move NAME weapon W anim CLIP windup S active S recover S reach M arc DEG hit HP [knock M/S] [lift M/S] [step M/S]
#        [cancel F] [breaks AMOUNT] [mastery N]
#
# windup, active, recover   the parts of it, seconds. The clip (assets/world/anim) stretches to them.
# reach, arc                how far, and how wide around where it faces
# hit, knock, lift          what it does to a body
# step                      it carries you forward while it lands
# cancel                    how far into the recovery (0 to 1) you can go on to something else. This is what makes a move a link.
# breaks                    force mana left where it strikes the world, if what you hold takes nothing out of it: the law does the breaking
# mastery                   the level of skill with this weapon it takes to know it
# walk                      of your speed, what you keep while it is under way (0.25 unless it says)
# rounds                    how many times it goes across its arc in the time it has, hitting everyone again each time
# on                        which key it starts on (0 left, 1 right, 2 the third), until you put something else there
#
# What it costs in stamina is worked out from what it does (Melee.cpp, move_stamina).

weapon fists mass 0.5 length 0.35 leaf 1
weapon sword model assets/world/weapons/sword.model mass 1.3 length 1.35 wood 0.5 leaf 2
weapon axe   model assets/world/weapons/axe.model   mass 2.4 length 1.3 wood 4 leaf 4 stone 0.15
weapon spear model assets/world/weapons/spear.model mass 1.5 length 2.4
weapon bite mass 0.5 length 0.4
weapon tusk mass 1.2 length 0.5
weapon claw mass 2.0 length 0.6
weapon pickaxe model assets/world/weapons/pickaxe.model mass 2.2 length 1.2 stone 3 wood 0.5 leaf 1

move jab      weapon fists anim jab        windup 0.09 active 0.05 recover 0.16 reach 1.0 arc 50  hit 11 knock 5  cancel 0.1
move hook     weapon fists anim hook       windup 0.17 active 0.06 recover 0.26 reach 1.1 arc 90  hit 18 knock 9  cancel 0.4 mastery 1
move kick     weapon fists anim kick       windup 0.24 active 0.07 recover 0.34 reach 1.4 arc 50  hit 15 knock 16 lift 3 cancel 0.5 mastery 2

move slash    weapon sword anim slash      windup 0.14 active 0.06 recover 0.26 reach 2.0 arc 130 hit 26 knock 8  cancel 0.2
move thrust   weapon sword anim thrust     windup 0.2 active 0.05 recover 0.3 reach 2.5 arc 30  hit 32 knock 13 step 9 cancel 0.3 mastery 1
move rising   weapon sword anim rising_cut windup 0.2 active 0.07 recover 0.32 reach 1.9 arc 80  hit 22 knock 4 lift 12 cancel 0.4 mastery 2
move overhead weapon sword anim overhead   windup 0.52 active 0.07 recover 0.5 reach 2.2 arc 50  hit 55 knock 14 breaks 2 shock 2.2 cancel 0.5 mastery 3

move chop     weapon axe   anim overhead   windup 0.42 active 0.07 recover 0.46 reach 1.9 arc 55  hit 46 knock 12 breaks 4 shock 1.6 cancel 0.4
move sweep    weapon axe   anim sweep      windup 0.4 active 0.1 recover 0.5 reach 2.2 arc 190 hit 34 knock 16 breaks 1.5 cancel 0.5 mastery 1
move hew      weapon axe   anim slash      windup 0.28 active 0.07 recover 0.38 reach 1.9 arc 100 hit 36 knock 10 breaks 3 cancel 0.3 mastery 2

move poke     weapon spear anim poke       windup 0.14 active 0.05 recover 0.2 reach 3.2 arc 22  hit 22 knock 7  cancel 0.2
move lunge    weapon spear anim lunge      windup 0.3 active 0.08 recover 0.42 reach 3.5 arc 24  hit 38 knock 15 step 14 cancel 0.4 mastery 1
move pierce   weapon spear anim lunge      windup 0.26 active 0.07 recover 0.36 reach 3.4 arc 26  hit 30 knock 12 step 8 cancel 0.4 mastery 2

move pick    weapon pickaxe anim overhead windup 0.32 active 0.07 recover 0.34 reach 1.8 arc 40 hit 20 knock 4 cancel 0.4
move jab_pick weapon pickaxe anim thrust  windup 0.2 active 0.06 recover 0.28 reach 1.7 arc 30 hit 14 knock 6 cancel 0.3 mastery 1

# What beasts have instead.
move bite     weapon bite  anim beast_lunge windup 0.28 active 0.08 recover 0.42 reach 1.1 arc 70  hit 14 knock 5 step 8
move gore     weapon tusk  anim beast_lunge windup 0.38 active 0.10 recover 0.55 reach 1.3 arc 60  hit 24 knock 16 lift 4 step 11
move maul     weapon claw  anim beast_rear  windup 0.55 active 0.10 recover 0.70 reach 1.7 arc 100 hit 42 knock 18 shock 1.2 mastery 1
move swipe    weapon claw  anim beast_lunge windup 0.30 active 0.10 recover 0.45 reach 1.5 arc 90  hit 22 knock 9

# The great blows: long to come, all of the body in them, and you see them coming.
move half_turn weapon sword anim half_turn windup 0.38 active 0.13 recover 0.42 reach 2.5 arc 210 hit 50 knock 14 lift 3 step 7 breaks 1 cancel 0.5 mastery 3 on 1
move wind_up   weapon axe   anim wind_up   windup 0.5  active 1.6  recover 0.5  reach 2.4 arc 360 hit 24 knock 11 lift 2 breaks 2 rounds 4 walk 0.6 cancel 0.5 mastery 3 on 1
move charge    weapon spear anim charge    windup 0.35 active 0.35 recover 0.45 reach 3.0 arc 30  hit 54 knock 42 lift 7 step 20 breaks 2 cancel 0.5 mastery 2 on 1
